            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I personally don't really like this in core buffers. Especially since explicitly typing `:quit` or `:close` is arguably better UX since it requires explicit effort to not confirm the update.\n\nAnd especially since `<C-w><C-q>` or `<C-w>q` almost as equally ergonomic as a single `q`.",
